        "sid": "ZEC 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka atiŋo waŋa malo, ci aneno buk adola ma twarre! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lamalaika openya ni, “Ineno gin aŋo?” An adokke iye ni, “Aneno buk adola ma twarre; borre romo futi pyeradek, ki lacce romo futi apar wiye abic.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka lamalaika dok owacca ni, “Man en lok me ceno dano, ma woto i lobo ducu, pien gicoyo tuŋ cel ni jo ducu ma kwalo kwo gibiryemogi woko cakke tin, dok gicoyo i tuŋ mukene ni, jo ducu ma kwoŋo kwoŋ me go ba gibiryemogi woko bene cakke tin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doŋ abicwalo buk man me ceno dano me wot woko, wek ocidony i ot pa lakwo ki i ot pa ŋat ma kwoŋo kwoŋ i nyiŋa go ba goba; bibedo i ode kun tyeko woko, kadi wa bao ki godi ducu ma gigero kwede.” Man lok pa Rwot me mony kikome.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen lamalaika ma obedo ka lok kweda obino owacca-ni, “Tiŋ waŋi malo koŋ inen gin ma tye ka kato woko-ni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka apenye ni, “Man kono gin aŋo?” En odokka iye ni, “Man aduku ma kato woko.” Ka dok owacci, “Man bal ma tye i lobo-ni ducu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, gitiŋo nyonyo racac mapek ma onoŋo giumo ki doge, ci aneno dako mo onoŋo tye obedo i aduku! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lamalaika owaco ni, “Man aye tim marac.” Odiyo wi dako odwoko i aduku, dok odiro nyonyo mapek ca ocego ki doge woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atiŋo waŋa dok malo, ci aneno mon aryo ma gitye ka twarre ma gibino kun yamo tye i bwomgi; onoŋo gitye ki bwomgi macalo bwom acebe. Gucako tiŋo aduku gitero i kin lobo ki polo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok apenyo lamalaika ma tye ka lok kweda ni, “Gitero aduku-ni kono kwene?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lamalaika odokka iye ni, “I lobo me Cinar, wek giger ot pire; ka man doŋ gigero otum, gibicibo aduku i kabedo ma giyubo pire kunnu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
